    "description": "Tag suggestions on the rule create/edit pages (6th AI integration). A token trie is built in memory from the tags of these taxonomy / galaxy families only (their names, values and galaxy synonyms) — the other families (firearms, drugs, satellites, …) are never looked at. families: namespaces kept; include_used_min_rules: also keep any tag already used on at least this many rules, whatever its family (0 = off); exclude_prefixes: tags whose name starts with one of these are never suggested (markings like TLP / PAP, already set by default on every rule); min_term_length: shorter words are ignored (technique ids like T1059 are always kept); stopwords: words never matched on their own; max_candidates: matches shown / handed to the AI; max_ai_suggestions: tags the AI may keep; simulate_ai: no model call, the AI step is simulated from the trie scores (same answer shape, model shown as \"simulated\") — for a dev machine whose local Ollama is too slow, never on production.",
